Earlier, somebody posted a way to deal with vault guards by following
them and dropping and retrieving your $ along the way.  If you got
into the vault by randomly teleporting, DO NOT DO THIS! Chances are,
by the time the guard arrives, you will be almost ready to teleport
right outta there.  If this is the case, and you start to folloe the
guard, you might teleport away leaving all of you money behind, and
unless you,ve got a wand of digging, it's bye-bye cash!  Just sit
in the vault (holding the cash tightly) until you teleport away from
the guard.

